msgctxt "auditClassicalNumberBunching|"
msgid ""
"This analysis analyzes the frequency with which values get repeated within a "
"dataset (called “number-bunching”) to statistically identify whether the "
"data were likely tampered with. Unlike Benford’s law this approach examines "
"the entire number at once, not only the first or last digit (Simonsohn, "
"2019).\n"
"\n"
"To determine whether the data show an excessive amount of bunching, the null "
"hypothesis that the data do not contain an unexpected amount of repeated "
"values is tested. To quantify what is expected, this test requires the "
"assumption that the integer portions of the numbers are not associated with "
"their decimal portions."
msgstr ""
"此分析分析数据集内值被重复出现的频率（称为“数字聚拢”），以统计识别数据是否可"
"能被篡改。与本福特定律不同，该方法一次性检查整个数字，而非仅查看首位或末位数"
"字（Simonsohn，2019）。\n"
"\n"
"为了确定数据是否显示出过多的聚拢，检验数据不包含异常数量的重复值这一原假设。"
"为了量化预期，该检验需要假设数字的整数部分与其小数部分不相关。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalNumberBunching|"
msgid ""
"In this box the variable is selected whose digits should be analyzed for "
"repeated values."
msgstr "在此方框中，选择要对其位数进行重复值分析的变量。"

