msgid "Add variables to sample"
msgstr "向样本添加变量"

msgctxt "auditClassicalWorkflow|"
msgid "Sample List"
msgstr "样本列表"

msgctxt "auditSelection|"
msgid ""
"The required number of sampling units that should be selected from the "
"population, which are determined by the *units* option. By default, when no "
"book values are provided, the sampling units are items (rows). When book "
"values are provided, the ideal sampling units to use are monetary units."
msgstr ""
"所需从总体中选择的抽样单位数，由*单位*选项决定。默认情况下，当未提供账面值"
"时，抽样单位为项目（行）。当提供账面值时，理想的抽样单位是货币单位。"

msgctxt "auditSelection|"
msgid "Report"
msgstr "报告"

msgctxt "Display|"
msgid "Format Output"
msgstr "格式输出"

msgctxt "Display|"
msgid "Choose how to display numbers in tables and figures."
msgstr "选择在表格和图中显示数字的方式。"

msgctxt "Display|"
msgid "Numeric"
msgstr "数字"

msgctxt "Display|"
msgid "Display numbers as numeric values."
msgstr "将数字显示为数值。"

msgctxt "Display|"
msgid "Percentages"
msgstr "百分比"

msgctxt "Display|"
msgid "Display numbers as percentages."
msgstr "将数字显示为百分比。"

msgctxt "Display|"
msgid "Monetary units"
msgstr "货币单位"

msgctxt "Display|"
msgid "Display numbers as monetary units."
msgstr "将数字显示为货币单位。"

msgctxt "DownloadReport|"
msgid "<b>Download Report</b>"
msgstr "<b>下载报告</b>"

msgctxt "AddVariables|"
msgid "Column name selection result"
msgstr "列名选择结果"

msgctxt "AddVariables|"
msgid "selected"
msgstr "已选择"

msgctxt "AddVariables|"
msgid "Column name audit result"
msgstr "列名审计结果"

msgctxt "AddVariables|"
msgid "auditResult"
msgstr "auditResult"

msgctxt "Annotation|"
msgid "Annotation"
msgstr "标注"

msgctxt "Annotation|"
msgid "Specify how to annotate your data set."
msgstr "指定如何标注您的数据集。"

msgctxt "Annotation|"
msgid "Audit value"
msgstr "审计值"

msgctxt "Annotation|"
msgid ""
"Annotate the items in the selection with their audit (true) values. This "
"approach is recommended (and automatically selected) when the items have a "
"monetary value."
msgstr ""
"使用所选项目的审计（真实）值对其进行标注。当这些项目具有货币价值时，推荐（并"
"自动选择）此方法。"

msgctxt "Annotation|"
msgid "Adds a column to specify the audit values of the items."
msgstr "添加一列以指定项目的审计值。"

msgctxt "Annotation|"
msgid "Correct / Incorrect"
msgstr "正确 / 不正确"

msgctxt "Annotation|"
msgid ""
"Annotate the items in the selection with correct (0) or incorrect (1). This "
"approach is recommended (and automatically selected) when your items do not "
"have a monetary value."
msgstr ""
"使用正确（0）或不正确（1）对所选项目进行标注。当您的项目不具有货币价值时，推"
"荐（并自动选择）此方法。"

msgctxt "Annotation|"
msgid "Adds a column to specify the items as correct (0) or misstated (1)."
msgstr "添加一列以将项目指定为正确（0）或错报（1）。"

msgctxt "AuditVariable|"
msgid "Audit Result (required)"
msgstr "审计结果（必填）"

msgctxt "AuditVariable|"
msgid ""
"A numeric variable that contains the audited (true) values of the items in "
"the population, or a binary variable that contains a 0 (correct item) or a 1 "
"(misstated item) for each row."
msgstr ""
"包含总体中项目审计（真实）值的数值变量，或包含每行 0（正确项目）或 1（错报项"
"目）的二值变量。"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "Data Type"
msgstr "数据类型"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "The type of input data for the analysis."
msgstr "分析输入数据的类型。"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "Population"
msgstr "总体"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "Use the population as input data."
msgstr "使用总体作为输入数据。"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "Sample"
msgstr "样本"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "Use a sample of the population as input data."
msgstr "使用总体样本作为输入数据。"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "Summary statistics"
msgstr "汇总统计"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "Use summary statistics from a sample as input data."
msgstr "使用样本的汇总统计作为输入数据。"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "Sample size"
msgstr "样本规模"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "The number of sampling units that have been audited."
msgstr "已被审计的抽样单位数。"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "Misstatements"
msgstr "错报"

msgctxt "DataType|"
msgid "The number of misstatements that have been found in the sample."
msgstr "在样本中发现的错报数。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Add additional tables about the evaluation to the report."
msgstr "在报告中添加有关评估的其他表格。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Misstated items"
msgstr "存在错报的项目"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a table containing the items in the sample for which the booked "
"(recorded) value does not equal the audit (true) value."
msgstr "生成一个包含样本中账面（记录）值不等于审计（真实）值的项目的表格。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Prior and posterior"
msgstr "先验与后验"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a table that shows statistics for the prior distribution and the "
"posterior distribution."
msgstr "生成一个显示先验分布和后验分布统计量的表格。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Corrections to population"
msgstr "对总体的修正"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a table that shows the required corrections to the population (in "
"monetary units) after which the conditions outlined in the sampling "
"objectives have been met."
msgstr ""
"生成一个显示抽样目标中概述的条件已满足后所需的（以货币单位计的）总体修正的表"
"格。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Assumption checks"
msgstr "假设检验"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a table that displays inference for the correlation between the "
"book values and the taints."
msgstr "生成一个显示账面值与污染比例之间相关性推断的表格。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Confidence interval"
msgstr "置信区间"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Width of the one-sided confidence interval for the population correlation."
msgstr "总体相关性的单侧置信区间的宽度。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "图"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Add additional figures about the evaluation to the report."
msgstr "在报告中添加有关评估的其他图。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Sampling objectives"
msgstr "抽样目标"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a horizontal bar chart comparing the most likely misstatement (MLE) "
"and quantities relevant to the sampling objectives."
msgstr "生成一个比较最可能错报（MLE）与抽样目标相关量值的水平条形图。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Estimates"
msgstr "估计值"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a figure showing the range of plausible values for the misstatement "
"for the population and all subpopulations (if applicable)."
msgstr "生成一个显示总体及所有子总体（若适用）错报的合理值范围的图。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a figure that shows the posterior and the posterior distribution."
msgstr "生成一个显示先验和后验分布的图。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Additional info"
msgstr "其他信息"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Add additional information to the figure, namely a visualization of the "
"Bayes factor and the estimates in text."
msgstr "在图中添加其他信息，即以文本形式直观展示贝叶斯因子和估计值。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Posterior predictive"
msgstr "后验预测"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a figure that shows the predictions of the posterior distribution "
"on the data level."
msgstr "生成一个在数据层面显示后验分布预测的图。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Scatter plot"
msgstr "散点图"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a scatter plot comparing the book values in the sample against "
"their audit values. Items for which these two values do not match are "
"colored in red."
msgstr ""
"生成一个比较样本中账面值与其审计值的散点图。这两个值不匹配的项目以红色着色。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Display correlation"
msgstr "显示相关性"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Add a correlation line to the figure."
msgstr "在图中添加相关性线。"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Display item ID's"
msgstr "显示条目 ID"

msgctxt "EvaluationOutput|"
msgid "Display the row number of the misstated items in the figure."
msgstr "在图中显示存在错报的项目的行号。"

msgctxt "EvaluationVariablesList|"
msgid "Selection Counter (optional)"
msgstr "选择计数器（可选）"

msgctxt "EvaluationVariablesList|"
msgid "Selection Counter (required)"
msgstr "选择计数器（必填）"

msgctxt "EvaluationVariablesList|"
msgid ""
"An ordinal variable that indicates how many sampling units are selected for "
"each item and thus how many times the item should be counted in the "
"evaluation."
msgstr ""
"指示每个项目被选择多少个抽样单位，从而指示项目在评估中应被计数多少次的序数变"
"量。"

msgctxt "EvaluationVariablesList|"
msgid "Stratum (optional)"
msgstr "分层（可选）"

msgctxt "EvaluationVariablesList|"
msgid ""
"A nominal variable that indicates to which subgroup (strata) of the "
"population an item belongs."
msgstr "指示项目属于总体哪个子组（层）的定类变量。"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Credible Interval (Alt. Hypothesis)"
msgstr "可信区间（备择假设）"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Confidence Interval (Alt. Hypothesis)"
msgstr "置信区间（备择假设）"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Credible Interval"
msgstr "可信区间"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Confidence Interval"
msgstr "置信区间"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Specify the type of interval and the alternative hypothesis."
msgstr "指定区间类型和备择假设。"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Upper bound (< materiality)"
msgstr "上界（< 重要性）"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Upper bound"
msgstr "上界"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid ""
"Produces a one-sided upper bound for the misstatement in the population."
msgstr "生成总体错报的单侧上界。"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Two-sided (≠ materiality)"
msgstr "双侧（≠ 重要性）"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Two-sided"
msgstr "双侧"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Produces a two-sided interval for the misstatement in the population."
msgstr "生成总体错报的双侧区间。"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Lower bound (> materiality)"
msgstr "下界（> 重要性）"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid "Lower bound"
msgstr "下界"

msgctxt "IntervalType|"
msgid ""
"Produces a one-sided lower bound for the misstatement in the population."
msgstr "生成总体错报的单侧下界。"

msgctxt "ExplanatoryText|"
msgid "Display"
msgstr "显示"

msgctxt "ExplanatoryText|"
msgid ""
"Specify options that have an effect on the look and feel of the audit report."
msgstr "指定影响审计报告外观和感觉的选项。"

msgctxt "ExplanatoryText|"
msgid "Explanatory text"
msgstr "说明性文本"

msgctxt "ExplanatoryText|"
msgid ""
"When checked, enables explanatory text in the analysis to help interpret the "
"procedure and the statistical results."
msgstr "勾选后，在分析中启用说明性文本，以帮助解释过程和统计结果。"

msgctxt "ExplanatoryText|"
msgid "Show explanatory text in the audit report"
msgstr "在审计报告中显示说明性文本"

msgctxt "Algorithm|"
msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "算法"

msgctxt "Algorithm|"
msgid "Partial projection"
msgstr "部分投影"

msgctxt "Algorithm|"
msgid ""
"This algorithm enables you to separate the known and the unknown "
"misstatement in the population to be more efficient. Note that this requires "
"the assumption that the taints in the sample are representative of the "
"taints in the unseen part of the population."
msgstr ""
"此算法使您能够分离总体中的已知和未知错报，以提高效率。请注意，这需要假设样本"
"中的污染比例代表了总体未见部分中的污染比例。"

msgctxt "Algorithm|"
msgid "Click to learn more about this algorithm"
msgstr "单击以了解有关此算法的更多信息"

msgctxt "Algorithm|"
msgid "Share information"
msgstr "共享信息"

msgctxt "Algorithm|"
msgid ""
"This algorithm enables you to share information about the misstatement "
"across different subgroups in the population (strata)."
msgstr "此算法使您能够在总体中的不同子组（层）之间共享错报信息。"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid "Audit Risk Model"
msgstr "审计风险模型"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid "Inherent risk"
msgstr "固有风险"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid "High"
msgstr "高"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "中"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid "Low"
msgstr "低"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定义"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid ""
"A category or probability for the inherent risk. Inherent risk is defined as "
"the risk of material misstatement posed by an error or omission in a "
"financial statement due to a factor other than a failure of internal control."
msgstr ""
"固有风险的类别或概率。固有风险定义为由于内部控制的失败以外的因素导致财务报表"
"中出现重大错报的风险。"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid "The percentage that corresponds with the inherent risk probability."
msgstr "与固有风险概率对应的百分比。"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid "Control risk"
msgstr "控制风险"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid ""
"A category or probability for the internal control risk. Control risk is "
"defined as the risk of a material misstatement in the financial statements "
"arising due to absence or failure in the operation of relevant controls of "
"the auditee."
msgstr ""
"内部控制风险的类别或概率。控制风险定义为由于被审计单位相关控制缺失或运作失效"
"而导致财务报表出现重大错报的风险。"

msgctxt "AuditRiskModel|"
msgid "The percentage that corresponds with the control risk probability."
msgstr "与控制风险概率对应的百分比。"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid "Critical Items"
msgstr "关键项目"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid "Choose how to handle critical items in the data set."
msgstr "选择如何处理数据集中的关键项目。"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid "Negative book values"
msgstr "负账面值"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid "Isolates negative book values from the population."
msgstr "将负账面值从总体中分离出来。"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid "Column name"
msgstr "列名"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid "critical"
msgstr "critical"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid ""
"Name for the column containing the critical item indicator to be added to "
"the data set."
msgstr "要添加到数据集中的包含关键项目标记的列的名称。"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid "Keep"
msgstr "保留"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid "Retains the critical items to be inspected as part of the sample."
msgstr "保留关键项目作为样本的一部分进行检查。"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "移除"

msgctxt "CriticalItems|"
msgid "Removes the critical items in the analysis."
msgstr "在分析中移除关键项目。"

msgctxt "ExpectedErrors|"
msgid "Expected Misstatements"
msgstr "期望错报"

msgctxt "ExpectedErrors|"
msgid ""
"The expected misstatements are the tolerable misstatements that can be found "
"in the sample while still achieving the conditions outlined in the sampling "
"objectives. It is advised to set this value conservatively to minimize the "
"probability of the observed misstatements exceeding the expected "
"misstatements, which would imply that insufficient work has been done in the "
"end."
msgstr ""
"期望错报是在仍能实现抽样目标中概述条件的同时可在样本中容忍的错报。建议保守地"
"设置此值，以最小化观测错报超过期望错报的概率，因为那将意味着最终所做的工作不"
"足。"

msgctxt "ExpectedErrors|"
msgid "Relative"
msgstr "相对"

msgctxt "ExpectedErrors|"
msgid ""
"Enter the expected misstatements as a percentage relative to the total size "
"of the sample."
msgstr "输入期望错报，作为样本总规模的百分比。"

msgctxt "ExpectedErrors|"
msgid "The percentage of expected misstatements in the sample."
msgstr "样本中期望错报的百分比。"

msgctxt "ExpectedErrors|"
msgid "Absolute"
msgstr "绝对"

msgctxt "ExpectedErrors|"
msgid "Enter the expected misstatements as an absolute value."
msgstr "输入期望错报的绝对值。"

msgctxt "ExpectedErrors|"
msgid "The number of expected misstatements in the sample."
msgstr "样本中期望错报的数量。"

msgctxt "ExpectedErrors|"
msgid "All possible"
msgstr "所有可能"

msgctxt "ExpectedErrors|"
msgid ""
"Do not make an assumption about the expected misstatements in the sample."
msgstr "不对样本中的期望错报做出假设。"

msgctxt "Iterations|"
msgid "Iterations"
msgstr "迭代"

msgctxt "Iterations|"
msgid "Specify how the sample size is computed."
msgstr "指定如何计算样本规模。"

msgctxt "Iterations|"
msgid "Increment"
msgstr "增量"

msgctxt "Iterations|"
msgid ""
"The increment alows you to limit the possible sample sizes to a multiple of "
"its value. For example, an increment of 5 allows only sample sizes of 5, 10, "
"15, 20, 25, etc."
msgstr ""
"增量允许您将可能的样本规模限制为其值的倍数。例如，增量为 5 只允许样本规模为 "
"5、10、15、20、25 等。"

msgctxt "Iterations|"
msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "最大值"

msgctxt "Iterations|"
msgid "The maximum sample size after which the algorithm terminates."
msgstr "算法终止后的最大样本规模。"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "分布"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid "Likelihood"
msgstr "似然"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid ""
"The likelihood is a function that relates the statistical model to the "
"observed data. Specifically, it quantifies the probability of observing the "
"data given the parameters of the model."
msgstr ""
"似然是将统计模型与观测数据联系起来的函数。具体而言，它量化了在给定模型参数的"
"情况下观测到这些数据的概率。"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid "Beta-binomial"
msgstr "贝塔-二项式"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid "Hypergeometric"
msgstr "超几何"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid ""
"The hypergeometric distribution assumes a finite population size and is "
"therefore generally used when the population size is small. It is a "
"probability distribution that models the number of errors (*K*) in the "
"population as a function of the population size (*N*), the number of "
"observed found errors (*k*) and the number of correct transactions (*n*). In "
"a Bayesian analysis, the conjugate prior for the hypergeometric likelihood "
"is the beta-binomial distribution."
msgstr ""
"超几何分布假设总体规模有限，因此通常在总体规模较小时使用。它是一种以总体规模"
"（*N*）、观测到的发现错误数（*k*）和正确交易数（*n*）为函数来建模错误数"
"（*K*）的概率分布。在贝叶斯分析中，超几何似然的共轭先验是贝塔-二项式分布。"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid "Beta"
msgstr "贝塔"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid "Binomial"
msgstr "二项式"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid ""
"The binomial distribution assumes an infinite population size and is "
"therefore generally used when the population size is large. It is a "
"probability distribution that models the rate of misstatement (*θ*) as a "
"function of the observed number of errors (*k*) and the number of correct "
"transactions (*n - k*). In a Bayesian analysis, the conjugate prior for the "
"binomial likelihood is the beta distribution."
msgstr ""
"二项式分布假设总体规模无限，因此通常在总体规模较大时使用。它是一种以观测错误"
"数（*k*）和正确交易数（*n - k*）为函数来建模错报率（*θ*）的概率分布。在贝叶斯"
"分析中，二项式似然的共轭先验是贝塔分布。"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid "Gamma"
msgstr "伽马"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid "Poisson"
msgstr "泊松"

msgctxt "Likelihood|"
msgid ""
"The Poisson distribution assumes an infinite population size and is "
"therefore generally used when the population size is large. It is a "
"probability distribution that models the rate of misstatement (*θ*) as a "
"function of the observed sample size (*n*) and the sum of the proportional "
"errors (*t*). In a Bayesian analysis, the conjugate prior for the Poisson "
"likelihood is the gamma distribution."
msgstr ""
"泊松分布假设总体规模无限，因此通常在总体规模较大时使用。它是一种以观测样本规"
"模（*n*）和比例误差之和（*t*）为函数来建模错报率（*θ*）的概率分布。在贝叶斯分"
"析中，泊松似然的共轭先验是伽马分布。"

msgctxt "PlanningOutput|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

msgctxt "PlanningOutput|"
msgid "Add additional tables about the planning to the report."
msgstr "在报告中添加有关规划的其他表格。"

msgctxt "PlanningOutput|"
