msgstr "生成一个比较样本规模的图：1）跨概率分布，2）跨样本中期望错误数。"

msgctxt "PlanningOutput|"
msgid "Presumed data distribution"
msgstr "假定数据分布"

msgctxt "PlanningOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a figure that displays the probability distribution implied by the "
"input options and the calculated sample size."
msgstr "生成一个显示由输入选项和计算出的样本规模所隐含的概率分布的图。"

msgctxt "PlanningOutput|"
msgid "Distribution of book values"
msgstr "账面值分布"

msgctxt "PlanningOutput|"
msgid "Produces a histogram of the *Book Value* column in the data set."
msgstr "生成数据集中*账面值*列的直方图。"

msgctxt "PlanningOutput|"
msgid "Prior distribution"
