msgstr "什么更重要？"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid ""
"In this question, it must be specified whether the focus is on correctly "
"classifying items into the positive class, the negative class, or both."
msgstr ""
"在此问题中，必须指定重点是正确地将项目分类到阳性类别、阴性类别，还是两者。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "Correctly classifying the positive class"
msgstr "正确定分类阳性类别"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid ""
"This option is selected if the interest is on correctly classifying items "
"into the positive class."
msgstr "如果关注正确定分类到阳性类别的项目，则选择此选项。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "Correctly classifying the negative class"
msgstr "正确定分类阴性类别"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid ""
"This option is selected if the interest is on correctly classifying items "
"into the negative class."
msgstr "如果关注正确定分类到阴性类别的项目，则选择此选项。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid ""
"This option is selected if the interest is on correctly classifying items "
"into both the positive and the negative class."
msgstr "如果关注正确定分类到阳性和阴性两个类别的项目，则选择此选项。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "What are the most costly errors?"
msgstr "哪些错误最昂贵？"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid ""
"In this question, it must be specified which classification errors "
"(incorrect classification of items in the positive class or incorrect "
"classification of items in the negative class) result in the greatest losses "
"(economic, social, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"在此问题中，必须指定哪些分类错误（错误分类阳性类别的项目或错误分类阴性类别的"
"项目）导致最大的损失（经济、社会等）。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "False positives"
msgstr "假阳性"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid ""
"This option is selected if false positives (incorrectly classifying an item "
"in the positive class when it belongs to the negative class) result in "
"greater losses."
msgstr ""
"如果假阳性（将属于阴性类别的项目错误分类到阳性类别）导致更大的损失，则选择此"
"选项。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "False negatives"
msgstr "假阴性"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid ""
"This option is selected if false negatives (incorrectly classifying an item "
"in the negative class when it belongs to the positive class) result in "
"greater losses."
msgstr ""
"如果假阴性（将属于阳性类别的项目错误分类到阴性类别）导致更大的损失，则选择此"
"选项。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "Report"
msgstr "报告"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "图"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "Add additional figures about the evaluation to the report."
msgstr "在报告中添加有关评估的其他图。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "Decision-making workflow"
msgstr "决策工作流程"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid ""
"Produces a figure showing the resulting path through the decision-making "
"workflow."
msgstr "生成一个显示决策工作流程所得路径的图。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairness|"
msgid ""
"Select the fairness metric for evaluating discrimination against the "
"unprivileged group(s)."
msgstr "选择用于评估对弱势组歧视的公平性度量。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "<b>1. Selection</b>"
msgstr "<b>1. 选择</b>"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "1. Selection"
msgstr "1. 选择"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid ""
"In this question, it must be specified whether the ground truth information "
"(i.e., the target to be predicted) is relevant or not for the analysis "
"context. In the context of item classification, the term ground truth "
"information refers to the true classification of items, obtained from "
"reliable sources or domain experts."
msgstr ""
"在此问题中，必须指定地面真实信息（即要预测的目标）在分析情境中是否相关。在项"
"目分类的情境中，地面真实信息指项目的真实分类，来自可靠的来源或领域专家。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "<b>Download Report</b>"
msgstr "<b>下载报告</b>"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "<b>To Evaluation</b>"
msgstr "<b>转到评估</b>"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "<b>2. Evaluation</b>"
msgstr "<b>2. 评估</b>"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "2. Evaluation"
msgstr "2. 评估"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgctxt "BayesFactorType|"
msgid "Choose which type of Bayes factor to display."
msgstr "选择要显示的贝叶斯因子类型。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorType|"
msgid "BF₁₀"
msgstr "BF₁₀"

msgctxt "BayesFactorType|"
msgid ""
"Bayes factor to quantify evidence for the alternative hypothesis relative to "
"the null hypothesis."
msgstr "用于量化备择假设相对于原假设证据的贝叶斯因子。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorType|"
msgid "BF₀₁"
msgstr "BF₀₁"

msgctxt "BayesFactorType|"
msgid ""
"Bayes factor to quantify evidence for the null hypothesis relative to the "
"alternative hypothesis."
msgstr "用于量化原假设相对于备择假设证据的贝叶斯因子。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorType|"
msgid "Log(BF₁₀)"
msgstr "Log(BF₁₀)"

msgctxt "BayesFactorType|"
msgid "Natural logarithm of BF10."
msgstr "BF10 的自然对数。"

msgctxt "ConfidenceLevel|"
msgid "Confidence"
msgstr "置信度"

msgctxt "ConfidenceLevel|"
msgid ""
"The confidence level used. The confidence level is the complement of the "
"audit risk: the risk that the user is willing to take to give an incorrect "
"judgment about the population. For example, if you want to use an audit risk "
"of 5%, this equals 95% confidence."
msgstr ""
"所使用的置信度。置信度是审计风险的补集：用户愿意承担的对总体做出错误判断的风"
"险。例如，如果您想使用 5% 的审计风险，则对应 95% 的置信度。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Add additional tables about the evaluation to the report."
msgstr "在报告中添加有关评估的其他表格。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Individual comparisons"
msgstr "个体比较"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a table comparing the unprivileged groups against the privileged "
"group."
msgstr "生成一个比较弱势组与特权组的表格。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Model performance"
msgstr "模型性能"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a table containing the performance measures for the classification, "
"including support, accuracy, precision, recall and F1-score."
msgstr ""
"生成一个包含分类性能指标的表格，包括支持度、准确率、精确度、召回率和 F1 分"
"数。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Confusion matrix"
msgstr "混淆矩阵"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Produces the confusion matrix for each group."
msgstr "为每个组生成混淆矩阵。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Display proportions"
msgstr "显示比例"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Displays proportions in the confusion table."
msgstr "在混淆表格中显示比例。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Transpose matrix"
msgstr "转置矩阵"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Transposes the confusion matrix."
msgstr "转置混淆矩阵。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "图"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Add additional figures about the evaluation to the report."
msgstr "在报告中添加有关评估的其他图。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Parity estimates"
msgstr "同型性估计"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a plot showing the parity statistics for each unprivileged group "
"against the privileged group."
msgstr "生成一个显示每个弱势组相对于特权组的同型性统计量的图。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Prior and posterior distribution"
msgstr "先验与后验分布"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Produces a figure that shows the prior and posterior distribution."
msgstr "生成一个显示先验与后验分布的图。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Bayes factor robustness check"
msgstr "贝叶斯因子稳健性检验"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a figure that shows the robustness of the Bayes factor to the prior "
"distribution."
msgstr "生成一个显示贝叶斯因子对先验分布稳健性的图。"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid "Sequential analysis"
msgstr "序贯分析"

msgctxt "FairnessOutput|"
msgid ""
"Produces a figure that shows the Bayes factor as a function of the sample "
"size."
msgstr "生成一个显示作为样本规模函数的贝叶斯因子的图。"

msgctxt "FairnessVariablesList|"
msgid "Ground Truth Information"
msgstr "地面真实信息"

msgctxt "FairnessVariablesList|"
msgid ""
"In this column, the ground truth information (i.e., the target to be "
"predicted) variable should be entered."
msgstr "在此列中，应输入地面真实信息（即要预测的目标）变量。"

msgctxt "FairnessVariablesList|"
msgid "Predictions"
msgstr "预测"

msgctxt "FairnessVariablesList|"
msgid "In this column, the predictions of the algorithm should be entered."
msgstr "在此列中，应输入算法的预测。"

msgctxt "FairnessVariablesList|"
msgid "Sensitive Attribute"
msgstr "敏感属性"

msgctxt "FairnessVariablesList|"
msgid ""
"In this column, the protected (i.e., sensitive) attribute should be entered."
msgstr "在此列中，应输入受保护（即敏感）属性。"

msgctxt "Hypotheses|"
msgid "Alt. Hypothesis"
msgstr "备择假设"

msgctxt "Hypotheses|"
msgid "Specify the alternative hypothesis."
msgstr "指定备择假设。"

msgctxt "Hypotheses|"
msgid "Unprivileged ≠ Privileged"
msgstr "弱势组 ≠ 特权组"

msgctxt "Hypotheses|"
msgid ""
"Test the alternative hypothesis that the fairness metric of an unprivileged "
"group is not equal to the fairness metric in the privileged group."
msgstr "检验弱势组的公平性度量不等于特权组公平性度量这一备择假设。"

msgctxt "Hypotheses|"
msgid "Unprivileged < Privileged"
msgstr "弱势组 < 特权组"

msgctxt "Hypotheses|"
msgid ""
"Test the alternative hypothesis that the fairness metric of an unprivileged "
"group is lower than the fairness metric in the privileged group."
msgstr "检验弱势组的公平性度量低于特权组公平性度量这一备择假设。"

msgctxt "Hypotheses|"
msgid "Unprivileged > Privileged"
msgstr "弱势组 > 特权组"

msgctxt "Hypotheses|"
msgid ""
"Test the alternative hypothesis that the fairness metric of an unprivileged "
"group is higher than the fairness metric in the privileged group."
msgstr "检验弱势组的公平性度量高于特权组公平性度量这一备择假设。"

msgctxt "Levels|"
msgid "Levels"
msgstr "水平"

msgctxt "Levels|"
msgid ""
"These options allow specification of the privileged group and the positive "
"class."
msgstr "这些选项允许指定特权组和阳性类别。"

msgctxt "Levels|"
msgid "Privileged group"
msgstr "特权组"

msgctxt "Levels|"
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

msgctxt "Levels|"
msgid ""
"The privileged group refers to the class in the protected variable that "
"historically or systematically experiences certain advantages, benefits, or "
"privileges."
msgstr "特权组指受保护变量中在历史上或系统性地享有某些优势、利益或特权的类别。"

msgctxt "Levels|"
msgid "Positive class"
msgstr "阳性类别"

msgctxt "Levels|"
msgid "The positive class in the target variable."
msgstr "目标变量中的阳性类别。"

msgctxt "PriorDistribution|"
msgid "Prior Distribution"
msgstr "先验分布"

msgctxt "PriorDistribution|"
msgid "Concentration"
msgstr "集中"

msgctxt "PriorDistribution|"
msgid "Specifies the concentration parameter for the Dirichlet prior."
msgstr "指定 Dirichlet 先验的集中参数。"

msgctxt "PriorDistribution|"
msgid "Seed"
msgstr "种子"

msgctxt "PriorDistribution|"
msgid ""
"Selects the seed for the random number generator in order to reproduce "
"results."
msgstr "选择随机数生成器的种子以复现结果。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalFairnessWorkflow|"
msgid ""
"In this question, it must be specified whether the focus is on correct "
"classifications, incorrect classifications, or both. The focus is on the "
"items' correct classification when evaluating the reliability of the audit "
"process in accurately identifying situations that conform to established "
"rules and procedures. The focus is on the items' incorrect classification "
"when addressing potential anomalies or irregularities, or when identifying "
"areas for improvement within the audit process."
msgstr ""
"在此问题中，必须指定重点是正确分类、错误分类，还是两者。在评估审计过程的可靠"
"性时，重点是项目的正确分类，以确保准确识别符合既定规则和程序的情况。在处理潜"
"在异常或不规范之处，或识别审计过程需改进的领域时，重点是项目的错误分类。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"Produces the confidence interval for the point estimate of the relative "
"frequencies."
msgstr "为相对频率的点估计生成置信区间。"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid "Expected counts"
msgstr "期望频数"

msgctxt "auditClassicalBenfordsLaw|"
msgid ""
"Produces the expected counts of the digits under the reference distribution."
msgstr "在参考分布下生成数字的期望频数。"

msgctxt "AuditVariable|"
msgid "Audit Value (required)"
msgstr "审计值（必填）"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Bayesian True Value Estimation"
msgstr "贝叶斯真实值估计"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid ""
"The Bayesian estimation analysis allows the user to estimate the true value "
"of a population on the basis of a sample."
msgstr "贝叶斯估计分析允许用户基于样本估计总体的真实值。"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Prior"
msgstr "先验"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Default parameters"
msgstr "默认参数"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Whether to use the default prior parameters"
msgstr "是否使用默认先验参数"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Custom parameters"
msgstr "自定义参数"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Whether to use custom prior parameters"
msgstr "是否使用自定义先验参数"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Prior mean μ"
msgstr "先验均值 μ"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "The prior parameter for the mean."
msgstr "均值的先验参数。"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Prior mean weight κ"
msgstr "先验均值权重 κ"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "The prior parameter for the implicit sample size of the mean."
msgstr "均值的隐含样本规模的先验参数。"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Prior variance σ2"
msgstr "先验方差 σ2"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "The prior parameter for the variance."
msgstr "方差的先验参数。"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Prior variance weight ν"
msgstr "先验方差权重 ν"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "The prior parameter for the implicit sample size of the variance."
msgstr "方差的隐含样本规模的先验参数。"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Report"
msgstr "报告"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "图"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Add additional figures about the analysis to the report."
msgstr "在报告中添加有关分析的其他图。"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid "Prior and posterior"
msgstr "先验与后验"

msgctxt "auditBayesianEstimation|"
msgid ""
"Produces a figure showing the prior and posterior distributions for the true "
"population value."
msgstr "生成一个显示真实总体值先验与后验分布的图。"

msgctxt "Confidence|"
msgid "Confidence"
msgstr "置信度"

msgctxt "Confidence|"
msgid ""
"The confidence level used. The confidence level is the complement of the "
"audit risk: the risk that the user is willing to take to give an incorrect "
"judgment about the population. For example, if you want to use an audit risk "
"of 5%, this equals 95% confidence."
msgstr ""
"所使用的置信度。置信度是审计风险的补集：用户愿意承担的对总体做出错误判断的风"
"险。例如，如果您想使用 5% 的审计风险，则对应 95% 的置信度。"

msgctxt "Estimator|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "Estimator|"
msgid "The type of method used to estimate the true value of the population."
msgstr "用于估计总体真实值的方法类型。"

msgctxt "Estimator|"
msgid "Direct estimator"
msgstr "直接估计量"

msgctxt "Estimator|"
msgid "The Bayesian direct estimator."
msgstr "贝叶斯直接估计量。"

msgctxt "Estimator|"
msgid "Difference estimator"
msgstr "差异估计量"

msgctxt "Estimator|"
msgid "The Bayesian difference estimator."
msgstr "贝叶斯差异估计量。"

msgctxt "Estimator|"
msgid "Ratio estimator"
msgstr "比率估计量"

msgctxt "Estimator|"
msgid "The Bayesian ratio estimator."
msgstr "贝叶斯比率估计量。"

msgctxt "Estimator|"
msgid "Regression estimator"
msgstr "回归估计量"

msgctxt "Estimator|"
msgid "The Bayesian regression estimator."
msgstr "贝叶斯回归估计量。"

msgctxt "Samplesize|"
msgid "Required sample size"
msgstr "所需样本规模"

msgctxt "Samplesize|"
msgid ""
"Produces a table showing the required sample size to achive a desired "
"precision."
msgstr "生成一个显示为实现所需精密度所需样本规模的表格。"

msgctxt "Samplesize|"
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "精密度"

msgctxt "Samplesize|"
msgid "The value of the precision."
msgstr "精密度的值。"

msgctxt "Scatterplot|"
msgid "Scatter plot"
msgstr "散点图"

msgctxt "Scatterplot|"
msgid ""
"Produces a scatter plot comparing the book values in the sample against "
"their audit values. Items for which these two values do not match are "
"colored in red."
msgstr ""
"生成一个比较样本中账面值与其审计值的散点图。这两个值不匹配的项目以红色着色。"

msgctxt "VariablesFormEstimation|"
msgid "Book Value"
msgstr "账面值"

msgctxt "VariablesFormEstimation|"
msgid ""
"A numeric variable that contains the book (recorded) values of the items in "
"the population."
msgstr "包含总体中项目账面（记录）值的数值变量。"

msgctxt "VariablesFormEstimation|"
msgid "Audit Value"
msgstr "审计值"

msgctxt "VariablesFormEstimation|"
msgid ""
"A numeric variable that contains the audited (true) values of the items in "
"the population."
msgstr "包含总体中项目审计（真实）值的数值变量。"
